# The one place the site's CID lives. Publishing a new version of the site is
# a commit that changes this line. kustomization.yaml copies it into the
# HTTPRoute (replacements), and pin-site.sh pins it and unpins the old one.
#
# The placeholder is the CID of an empty UnixFS directory, which Kubo always
# has locally -- it pins instantly and serves an empty listing until the real
# site replaces it.
